  "reasoning_summary": "Answers reflect the persona’s high extraversion and low neuroticism by embracing interactive problem-solving over rote memorization. The vocational background informs applied math focus, while history/philosophy hobbies subtly bridge theory with practical application. AI usage is framed as supplementary (e.g., translation) rather than primary, aligning with the persona’s modest conscientiousness and openness to structured but not rigid learning. Stationary points and PCA are simplified for accessibility, emphasizing visual or analogical metaphors to reduce perceived complexity."
